ive.google.com/file/d/1Lcbuy0OMmZAdzQUrEQN4X9FtNvH3eRr1/view\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1L5-YLNFy3jSpLiO_nf0higHFWDDHnIxu/view\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1jzQD6m7z8hTG-RsHObVpYJnD9WUVkE4G/view\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/18JRShsyuc4EppV7yA8ut5s9AYWyiIlas/view"},{"status":"發布","main_category":"高年級","sub_category":"五年忠班","title":"我眼中的小花貓","author":"張睿綸","content":"　　我家雖然沒有養貓，但是有一次去南投的民宿，我看到牠的那一刻，我就開始喜愛牠了，我喜愛牠是因為牠非常親人。\n　　那一隻貓牠全身都是黃黃又橘橘的，牠有尖牙利齒的牙齒，還有一對白白的鬍鬚跟黑黑的斑紋,看起來牠吃的不怎麼多，實牠吃的比大胃王還多，主人一放下食物，牠就以飛快的速度跑過來吃，牠一邊吃東西，一邊喝水,看著牠小巧玲瓏的身體讓我很開心，牠還有一對大大的眼睛。\n　　每當我下樓時，牠就跑過來跟我撒嬌，但是明天我下樓時，卻沒有看到牠的身影，結果牠是去戶外尋找獵物了，我看到牠的時候，牠叼著一隻五顏六色的幼鳥，牠和其他鳥生活在風景怡人的日月潭，我跟家人們還勸牠不要再叼了，那一隻鳥是因為偷吃牠的食物，所以牠才會被咬。\n　　我們要回家時，我還戀戀不捨得跟他說再見，我回到家時，我還看著照片懷念牠可愛的模樣，我相信有機會我還可以再見到牠。\n\n","cover_image":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Lx4iteqpAeAS1QHsDrfSJnxbhp8dfqoc/view?usp=sharing","gallery":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Lx4iteqpAeAS1QHsDrfSJnxbhp8dfqoc/view?usp=sharing"},{"status":"發布","main_category":"中年級","sub_category":"三年忠班","title":"","author":"","content":"","cover_image":"","gallery":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1bfz5jSyRAdIR2YZ5rtYgkOCoqHIpdG4h/view\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1S6DCEiWVrwUMlWCbZi5eek3B4VcgTLI4/view\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1xNKnwO09--6kd4gpuiVtS_OCsIrx4Z1P/view\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1t0kAPd_sLaz8OVXE4qT_00NmJYuL73wB/view\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1N20esTnpEAKS7FMpa8M-huA1WJRgxzKI/view\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1fJx85e4MfOAesM6LrKLe-LtqrZ80w57d/view\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/158yO5OBtiugqkNrhM1cvgFtUiN99GiTN/view\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1NMj0BZXjYJ81OOyNCVOIzGWmFgStVmA7/view\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1GDva98AkHOLdCvdA7pvtNo6E_tDs0PEy/view\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1BFa4j9V6cbMvTXQXxteZMSodGkZ6j8W5/view\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1BIDqzB8e7Pm-J4IDMc9rSde5zuHUiaUM/view\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1BJ6lK7vPkULwsedg-TjCznsxenN-BiuC/view\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1BQPdKtuh6vOHS8qWDWN4T-uxXCIC